+    /**
+     * Returns true when the matched REST operation is declared with auth="false".
+     *
+     * <p>The generated custom REST resources are not represented by
+     * {@link OFBizServiceResource}, so the service-level auth exception above
+     * cannot see their definitions. Public operations such as login,
+     * registration and the product catalog are resolved from the same API model
+     * that registers the resources.</p>
